# Hand-authored accent stamps: one folder per source, each holding a diffuse
# (sRGB, alpha carries the cutout) and, optionally, an arm and a 16-bit disp
# map — either one absent is derived from the diffuse. One whole card per
# stamp, pinned at the bottom-middle: the pivot is where the card attaches and
# the image's up is the card's away-from-attachment direction, so a spire is
# drawn standing and a bunch of catkins is drawn twig-down, however it hangs.
# `source.json` declares lengthMetres. See ../../../../docs/scatter-forge/accents.md.
#
# Large binaries, kept out of git the way /assets/ is. An accent has no
# generated fallback, so a config that names one needs its art present.
# This rule keeps the file itself tracked so the folder survives a clone.
*
!.gitignore
